---
config:
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 20
    width: 100
    diagramMarginX: 20
    wrap: true
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Caller
    participant Front as Native front
    participant Worker as Policy worker
    participant Runner as Job runner
    participant Job as Managed job
    participant File as Result file
    Note over Front,Runner: Two source-verified phases<br/>observations and limits in guide
    alt TERM during selection
        Front->>Worker: Evaluate admitted policy
        Caller->>Front: TERM to native front
        Front->>Front: Selection handler latches cancellation (O7)
        Front->>Worker: Stop and wait, collect bounded diagnostics
        Note over Front,Job: No managed launch is reached
        Front-->>Caller: Propagate TERM, no result stdout
    else TERM during managed execution
        Front->>Runner: Paired launch after worker wait
        Runner->>Job: Spawn and supervise
        Caller->>Front: TERM to supervisor
        Front->>Runner: Signal latch in this process (O7)
        Runner->>Job: Forward TERM, KILL if required
        Runner->>Runner: Group cleanup before reap<br/>terminal recovery<br/>group confirmation
        Runner-->>Front: Interrupted ending, Group::Gone
        Front->>File: Reject even published result<br/>close channel
        Front->>Front: Join cleanup and signal latches<br/>front, runner and late runner
        Front-->>Caller: Propagate TERM, no result stdout
    end
    Note over Front,File: Separate lower-layer fixture publishes before TERM<br/>rejects the result and closes, then exits 0<br/>it does not perform CLI signal propagation
